"""
"Return to Zero" narration (081 English, 14 slides, 1:1 with the deck).
Arc: p1 hook (our formula for having may have been set backwards) -> p2 the definition, four moves
-> p3 the distinction that has to come early: this is not a passive death -> p4 three levels of
feeling, a ruler you hold yourself -> p5 the cosmological ground: total energy zero, the origin of
the coordinate system -> p6 what zero looks like: sun, flower, spring, bliss -> p7 three felt
pathways -> p8 no abiding in the heart, the good half included -> p9 the wondrous use of zero, a
two-way door -> p10 daily homework: no relying on power, achievements, the past -> p11 a new self
every day (a mirror, not a label) -> p12 to have nothing is to possess everything -> p13 the
seventh rung -> p14 the Greatest Creator is zero; I return to zero.
Care, six items, each to be executed: (1) p3 must settle "not a passive death" thoroughly; nothing
anywhere in the film may read as world-weariness, self-harm, numbness, or disdain for ordinary
life. (2) The extreme parallel clauses in Xuefeng's "wondrous use of zero" passage are never
quoted, paraphrased, or hinted at; take only the layer "set down what is not yours to carry", and
on that same page say plainly that it does NOT mean indifference to another person's pain.
(3) All three experiential pathways are named. The second (self-forgetting at sexual climax) gets
one factual sentence stating that Xuefeng places it alongside the other two because the mechanism
is identical -- the self is briefly absent. No testimony quoted, no description, no evaluation.
Land the page on Xuefeng's own follow-up: it is too short, so how do you make it last.
(4) Return to Zero swings both ways; p9 must land on stepping back out, or the entry reads as
avoidance. (5) No personal names. (6) On p11 the fixed-views diagnosis is a mirror for oneself,
never a label to hand to anyone else.
Positioning: 082 Zero-State and 083 Self-Coherence are separate entries immediately after -- this
entry owns the ACT of emptying; the zero state as a condition gets one line on p5 and one at the
close; Self-Coherence is named once at the end. 077 Humility already covered "the more you are
praised"; p10 takes the daily-homework angle instead. 075 Letting Go already exists; only the
"emptying" layer is taken. Non-Form Thinking, the Eight Thinking Ladders, No Abiding in the Heart,
the Second Home and the Elysium World each have their own entries and are named only.
Voice: Andrew. Written from the English source draft, not translated.
First line = hook. Target ~12-13 minutes.
"""

